  "_comment": "Courier delivery towns (setup/vmangos/pack.py makes the routes from them: every town to every other on its continent that one faction can use, a repeatable quest each). A town with a \"faction\" (alliance, horde) is that faction's; its routes go only to its own faction's towns and the neutral ones, and only that faction takes them. A route's quest is 190200 + 64 x its from-town's place here + its to-town's place, so towns are only ever added at the end. Each town's courier gives its routes and takes the ones to it; x, y, z and o are where they stand and face (par comes from the distance; Courier Jobs puts a player in front of them), zone is the quest log's heading for routes from there.",
